WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:04.160
SCP-096 Vs SCP-166.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:07.740
The mass-murdering Shy Guy vs the teenage
goddess of nature.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:09.679
Who will win out, life or death?

00:00:09.679 --> 00:00:10.860
Let’s find out.

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:15.539
The Shy Guy is an almost unstoppable monster
who’ll relentlessly hunt down and kill anybody

00:00:15.539 --> 00:00:20.900
who sees its face, ripping and tearing through
any obstacles in the way.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:25.390
SCP-166 is a faithful young lady with power
over the forces of nature, who has employed

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:30.619
these powers to fight against and immobilize
SCP-682 in a previous battle.

00:00:30.619 --> 00:00:37.420
While the nature powers of 166 may slow down
SCP-096, the monster will never, ever give

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:38.420
up.

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:42.220
Eventually, it would get to her, and punish
her for seeing its face.

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:46.329
We think SCP-096 would still take home the
win on this one.

